  "system": {
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements:</strong> You must be utilizing Zephyr Style.</p><p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1-2 Focus</p><p>You strike as the wind does — touching, then gone.</p><p>Spend -<strong>1 Focus</strong> and then make an attack with a <strong>Melee</strong> weapon. If the attack deals <strong>Damage</strong>, you may immediately move <strong>2 spaces</strong>. This movement does not trigger attacks or effects that respond to your movement.</p><p><strong>Enhancement.</strong> If, when you make this attack, you are at least <strong>2 spaces</strong> from the space you occupied at the start of your turn, you may spend an additional <strong>-1 Focus</strong> before rolling to gain <strong>Advantage</strong> on the attack.</p>",
